  (descr "Wuerth WP-SMBU REDCUBE SMT, M4 internal through-hole thread, 7466004R (tape and reel). Datasheet rev 001.003 2023-07-03 p.1: body D7.0, 5.0 mm above the board, 1.0 mm spigot (D5.0) into a D5.2 non-plated hole; recommended land D8.5 solder pad round the D5.2 NPTH; stencil D8.3 / D5.5 in four segments with 1.0 mm webs; paste 150 um. Here the copper ring ID is 5.7 mm (0.25 mm pull-back from the NPTH: KiCad hole clearance 0.25, JLC removes 0.2 mm of copper round an NPTH) and the paste ID 5.9 mm, so paste stays on copper. Rated 50 A @ 20 C, 1.2 N*m. Native-21 stage 35 (11-candidates/c35-smt-terminals).")
